    "resumed_from_research_run_id": "",
    "resumed_from_checkpoint_no": null,
    "status": "COMPLETED",
    "completion_terminal_state": "COMPLETED_VERIFIED",
    "final_report_title": "研究报告：Java 虚拟线程在哪个 JDK 版本正式发布，synchronized 导致的线程固定问题在哪个版本改善？引用 JEP。",
    "final_report_markdown": "# Java 虚拟线程的正式发布版本与 synchronized 固定问题的改进版本\n\nJava 虚拟线程（Virtual Threads）经 JEP 444 在 JDK 21 正式引入；而在 synchronized 方法或块内导致虚拟线程被固定（pin）的问题，由 JPE 491 在 Java 24 中得到改进，使虚拟线程在 synchronized 中也能卸载。\n\n## 直接回答\n\n本次核验的资料显示，虚拟线程（Virtual Threads）是在 Java 21 中通过 JEP 444 正式引入的，这是其首次正式发布的 JDK 版本。 [evidence:d1534ce9e7d2a5714c4dff346a1672379863bd223802a32a]\n\n针对 synchronized 导致的线程固定问题，JEP 491 在 JDK 24 中交付，它重新设计了 monitor 所有权的跟踪方式，改变了 JVM 中的 monitor 所有权，使虚拟线程在 synchronized 方法或块内也能卸载；该改动已集成到 Java 24，并出现在最新的 JDK 24 EA 构建中。因此，从 Java 24 及之后版本开始，原先对 synchronized 的规避建议已基本过时。 [evidence:4bc4dc9dcca5d846ed657aae41b5a100417d09c41bb96940] [evidence:b73edeaf2007857ed8529391c85cfa0f08ca22aa822e9ea6] [evidence:ca0605f92087e75140bb255f41040f7f561b4d454a22c975]\n\n## 对比表\n\n| 问题方面 | 版本 | 相关 JEP | 说明 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 虚拟线程正式引入 | Java 21 | JEP 444 | 虚拟线程通过 JEP 444 在 Java 21 中正式引入 [evidence:d1534ce9e7d2a5714c4dff346a1672379863bd223802a32a] |\n| synchronized 固定问题改善 | Java 24 | JEP 491 | JEP 491 重新设计 monitor 所有权跟踪，使虚拟线程可在 synchronized 方法或块内卸载；改动已集成到 Java 24，并见于最新 JDK 24 EA 构建 [evidence:4bc4dc9dcca5d846ed657aae41b5a100417d09c41bb96940] [evidence:b73edeaf2007857ed8529391c85cfa0f08ca22aa822e9ea6] [evidence:ca0605f92087e75140bb255f41040f7f561b4d454a22c975] |\n\n## Citation audit\n\n### Java Virtual Threads (Project Loom) · 正式发布版本\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:d1534ce9e7d2a5714c4dff346a1672379863bd223802a32a`\n- Exact quote: “Virtual threads, which were introduced in [Java 21](https://openjdk.org/projects/jdk/21/) via [JEP 444](https://openjdk.org/jeps/444)”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/86d75c6f-c947-4c69-9ce7-7ab5d00754f7/03befac17c8a8330429e6f1b8dc37cc948579eef1d052212c7306d81e745c191`\n- URL: https://bugs.openjdk.org/browse/JDK-8337395\n\n### Java Virtual Threads (Project Loom) · synchronized 固定问题改善版本\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:4bc4dc9dcca5d846ed657aae41b5a100417d09c41bb96940`\n- Exact quote: “ps/491), delivered in JDK 24, rearchitected monitor ownership tracking”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/c2611779-ce0b-48a5-8321-3aaee02fa3c0/14709ed55c86291639c6fa24bd0876fc244ffcc09eee5e9852a4106d28ee59e7`\n- URL: https://www.infoq.com/articles/virtual-threads-after-jdk24/\n\n### Java Virtual Threads (Project Loom) · synchronized 固定问题改善版本\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:b73edeaf2007857ed8529391c85cfa0f08ca22aa822e9ea6`\n- Exact quote: “With Java 24 and later, that recommendation is largely obsolete. JEP 491 changed monitor ownership in the JVM so a virtual thread can unmount while inside a `synchronized` method or block”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/c2611779-ce0b-48a5-8321-3aaee02fa3c0/f104544d9a02900b075e79bc1f31c519eb8291e45b93f4e0433e244ad2ddd8c6`\n- URL: https://www.theserverside.com/tip/How-to-solve-the-pinning-problem-in-Java-virtual-threads\n\n## 补充引用\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:ca0605f92087e75140bb255f41040f7f561b4d454a22c975`\n  - Exact quote: “This change is already integrated into Java 24 and available in the latest JDK 24 EA builds.”\n  - Snapshot: `research/external/c2611779-ce0b-48a5-8321-3aaee02fa3c0/91900e212db2abde3a86fe6484b91c222d13dec007b9feb4c0319d442df07116`\n  - URL: https://inside.java/2024/11/21/newscast-80/\n",
